-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2. Orthanc
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Imaging uses Orthanc (core GPL-3.0-or-later; the DICOMweb, Stone Web Viewer and
Orthanc Explorer 2 plugins AGPL-3.0-or-later) as a separate program: the companion
Bethesda PACS stack runs the unmodified official Docker image orthancteam/orthanc, and
this EMR talks to it only over its REST API and the DICOM protocol. No Orthanc code is
in this repository, linked into it or derived from it.

